{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事備年規，茲不重具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸方有兩序出班燒香，菴居宜免"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事備年規，茲不重具。是日麵供，諸方通例"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事具年規"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事具年規"}
