{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "客云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此會有開甘露門一𢯮，請依而行之，茲不重具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前某"}
