{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事具年規"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此日事具涅槃竟，茲不重書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道者喝云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無首座，但請堂\n中年臘高者代之"}
