{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如來成道文疏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祈晴、祈雨，每日二時回向，具于疏尾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "封皮用黃紙僉頭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啟建祈晴道場文疏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。依前疏內，眾神至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。祈禱至感應之日，別立疏滿散"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖位同前啟建疏內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "封皮同前"}
