{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滿散祈雨道場文䟽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧俗男女皆可通用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧入寂，男捐\n館，　女掩粧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧覺靈，\n　男神儀，　女叔靈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生申慶育兩句，隨意取一句用。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生申令旦，慶育之辰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經飜龍藏壽祝龜圖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大圓滿覺，　應迹西乾，　心包太虛，　量周沙界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "月旦月望"}
