{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總稱曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖師但云：增崇品位\n亦得。如於諸天三界一切神祇前，則曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如於一切亡者，則曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰："}
